# --- Large data objects ---
# Pre-processed, pseudobulk, and scored Seurat objects are large (tens to
# hundreds of MB) and are regenerated by running each dataset's .Rmd
# against its raw input data -- keep them out of git.
*.rds

# Rendered notebook previews (self-contained HTML, embeds every plot as
# base64 -- can run several MB per notebook) -- regenerated by re-knitting
# the source .Rmd, so not worth tracking.
*.nb.html

# Local R package library (R/ -- packages missing from the container
# image: multcomp, sandwich, TH.data as of this writing; picked up
# automatically as R's default per-user library path since the
# container's $HOME is bound to this directory -- see README's "Running
# the analyses"). Not tracked: reinstall with install.packages() instead
# of carrying ~150 binary package files in git.
/R/

# Raw GEO download for SUM149PT (Brown, Abdollahi, Wilkins et al. 2022,
# Sci. Adv. 8, eabj8002; re-fetchable from the GSE172609 GEO accession
# page -- the RNA-seq SubSeries of SuperSeries GSE172613;
# nf-core_fetchngs.sh/ids.csv target a raw-read reprocessing path that the
# current notebook doesn't actually use -- see README's Known gaps)
SUM149PT/from_geo/

# Per-dataset raw input data (self-contained under each dataset directory):
# - Baugh/data/: raw 10x outs directories (GEO accession GSE261252; see
#   Baugh/baugh_BH4paper_prep.Rmd's "Raw data" section) -- rename.sh is
#   small provenance code, not data, so it's kept
# - Chen/data/: CZ CELLxGENE h5ad, downloaded on demand by
#   Chen/ChenAtlas_malignant_pseudobulk_prep.Rmd (re-fetchable from the URL
#   in that notebook)
# - TCGA/data/: Broad Firehose batch-corrected pan-cancer matrix + clinical
#   metadata (original GDC/Firehose hosting pages are dead; provenance
#   tracked via citation instead -- see TCGA_BRCA_prep.Rmd's "Raw data"
#   section)
Baugh/data/
!Baugh/data/rename.sh
Chen/data/
TCGA/data/

# --- RStudio / R session state ---
# These land in the project directory because the Singularity container's
# $HOME is bound to $PWD (see singularity_Rstudio_451.sh) -- none of it is
# source or data.
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.cache/
.config/
.local/

# --- SLURM job logs from singularity_Rstudio_451.sh ---
slurm.*.out
slurm.*.err

# --- OS/editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
